Reproduce bounded checks:
python3 portability/capacity480/check.py CANDIDATE PREVIOUS_448_COMPILER

Thirty boundary checks cover exact491520 acceptance/exact491521 rejection
for bothELF and bothraw targets, finalEFI header/padding limits and previous
limit refusal. Six parity checks require byte-identical old-program outputs
across hosted, raw, EFI and real targets. Compact Zero source spelling keeps
the exact-boundary generators below the unchanged262144-byte source ceiling.
No generated boundary executable is run; no VM or user disk is touched.
